OL,3,GNEWSACouncil senior interims to provide
OL,4,A'stability'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornwall Council said interim staff
OL,7,Fcovering its vacant chief executive and
OL,8,Fchief finance officer roles is offering
OL,9,Fstability, its leader says.
OL,11,FCouncil members met on Tuesday to
OL,12,Fapprove the appointments to the senior
OL,13,Fpositions, plus set up a timetable for
OL,14,Fhiring permanent replacements.
OL,16,FLeigh Frost said the interim staff were
OL,17,Fin place until the unitary authority
OL,18,Fappointed full-timers in the new year,
OL,19,Fand those brought in would provide
OL,20,F"stability at the top of the
OL,21,Forganisation" in the meantime.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
