OL,3,GNEWSACouncil senior interims to provide
OL,4,A'stability'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer chief executive Kate Kennally
OL,7,Fstepped down after 10 years on 15
OL,8,FOctober. Three days later, Annabel
OL,9,FScholes resigned as chief operating and
OL,10,Ffinance officer. Both left for personal
OL,11,Freasons.
